      "writtenOn": "2025-11-09T10:29:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "450 is still a very high limit: it downloads 600kB of data over the network and it may take also several seconds to complete, depending on the bandwidth.\n\nSee the Issue 459059302 raised.\n\nCan we make this and the age configurable on a per-user basis? Or at least globally?\n\nThe rebase window is now blocking for this call to complete and the online rebase experience has suffered from it. You can also notice it on gerrit-review where the rebase window may be quite slow to open and be filled up with details.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 79,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "260bbffff770deb963eaf147e3726854a8db5947",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
