      "writtenOn": "2025-11-09T12:55:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e The rebase window is now blocking for this call to complete and the online rebase experience has suffered from it\n\nChange 521301 updated it to be non-blocking.\n\n\u003e Can we make this and the age configurable on a per-user basis? Or at least globally?\n\nWe are fetching less content than before so I don\u0027t really follow the comment.\n\nIf it\u0027s slow now then it was slow before.",
