      "writtenOn": "2025-11-09T14:36:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e \u003e The rebase window is now blocking for this call to complete and the online rebase experience has suffered from it\n\u003e \n\u003e Change 521301 updated it to be non-blocking.\n\nAh cool, I\u0027ll check that out.\n\n\u003e \u003e Can we make this and the age configurable on a per-user basis? Or at least globally?\n\u003e \n\u003e We are fetching less content than before so I don\u0027t really follow the comment.\n\u003e \n\u003e If it\u0027s slow now then it was slow before.\n\nSure, but still it loads 650kBytes of data for the example I\u0027ve mentioned in Issue 459059302. I was wondering if we really need so many changes to be loaded?",
      "parentUuid": "4004a3a0_d2104923",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 79,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "260bbffff770deb963eaf147e3726854a8db5947",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b1e08cdc_25c4a9cc",
        "filename": "polygerrit-ui/app/elements/change/gr-change-autocomplete/gr-change-autocomplete.ts",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 79,
      "author": {
        "id": 1083225
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-10T03:44:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I was wondering if we really need so many changes to be loaded?\n\nMy understanding is that there was no limit before. This gigantic request was being made at the start before the change was loaded and was causing delays in change rendering, hence we moved it to when the dialog was created.\n\nWe agreed on 450 due to the paging limit of our internal database.\n\nFeel free to update this to be a smaller number if you prefer.\n\nI tested this on Gerrit when I wrote it initially and the request resolved in 2-3 seconds.",
      "parentUuid": "8799cc9c_3175ffb7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 79,
        "endChar": 30
      },
